 and high-end sanitary ware in the bathrooms. These materials ensure both durability and elegance in every home.\n\nKey Information","score":0.85967577,"raw_content":null,"id":"95caf8-04"},{"url":"https://www.propertycrow.com/mumbai/propertyview_veena-smart-homes-kandivali-west_6744.html","title":"Veena Smart Homes Kandivali West Mumbai - Price, Location, Possession, Reviews, Investor Flats, Resale Flats | PropertyCrow.com","content":"Type, Area & Price\n\n## Price List\n\n| Type | Size | Price |\n --- \n| 1 BHK | 386 Sq.ft Carpet Area | 69.00 Lacs |\n| 2 BHK | 600 Sq.ft Carpet Area | 1.07 CR |\n\nNote: Above Mentioned Sizes and Prices are Approximate, Maintenance, Club Charges, Registration, Stamp duty, Car Parking, etc as applicable. \\Rates are indicative.\n\nAmenities\n\n## Project Amenities\n\n\\ Lift  \n\\ Landscaped Garden  \n\\ Gymnasium  \n\\ Children Play Area  \n\\ Indoor Games  \n\\ Pool Deck with Pergolas  \n\\ Swing  \n\\ Club House  \n\\ Meditation Room\n\nSpecifications\n\n## Project Specifications\n\n\\ Vitrified flooring  \n\\ Anti Skid in bathrooms  \n\\ Power Backup  \n\\ Aluminium Sliding Windows  \n\\ Weather Proof Paints  \n\\ High Branded Lifts      \n\\ Good Floor To Floor Height\n\nFloor Plans\n\n## Floor Plan\n\n2 BHK Floor Plan [...] About Project\n\n## VEENA SMART HOMES\n\nVeena Smart Homes is New residential project developed by Veena Developer located in Kandivali West, Mumbai. This project provide 1 BHK and 2 BHK Apartment with starting area from 386 Sq.ft To 600 Sq.ft Carpet Area.    \n  \nLocation:-  \nKandivali West has founded itself as the most sought-after locatio [...] n of tomorrow. Located on Mumbai’s Western line between Borivali and Malad, Kandivali West is basically a housing suburban area. With its vicinity to the Western Express Highway and an increased structure, the location is luring home buyers and retail players with a number of projects. Poinsur Gymkhana along with the freshly made Sachin Tendulkar Gymkhana in the 